            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Verified Claude account names

Bagel Meter now checks Claude's signed-in identity directly before showing or sharing usage. An old account name in Claude's settings can no longer label another account's numbers. If the saved profile and active login disagree, the app names the mismatch and asks you to reconnect. Existing profiles, history and logins are preserved.

The Windows helper also verifies Claude account identity before sharing a reading.
]]></description>
